{"seq":1,"slug":"vector-databases","title":"向量数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/vector-databases","wordCount":615,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量数据库\">向量数据库</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要向量数据库\">为什么需要向量数据库</h2><p>向量数据库是 RAG（检索增强生成）系统的核心基础设施。它专门用于存储和检索高维向量（嵌入），支持高效的相似度搜索。传统数据库按精确匹配查询，向量数据库则按语义相似性查询。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    Q[&quot;用户查询&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;嵌入模型&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; V[&quot;查询向量&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; DB[&quot;向量数据库&quot;]&#10;    DB --&gt; R[&quot;Top-K 相似文档&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; LLM[&quot;送入 LLM 生成回答&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    Q[\"用户查询\"] --&gt; E[\"嵌入模型\"]\n    E --&gt; V[\"查询向量\"]\n    V --&gt; DB[\"向量数据库\"]\n    DB --&gt; R[\"Top-K 相似文档\"]\n    R --&gt; LLM[\"送入 LLM 生成回答\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>向量数据库的核心操作包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>插入 (Upsert)</td>\n<td>添加或更新向量</td>\n<td>O(log n) ~ O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索 (Search)</td>\n<td>查找最近邻</td>\n<td>O(log n) ~ O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除 (Delete)</td>\n<td>移除向量</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过滤 (Filter)</td>\n<td>元数据条件过滤</td>\n<td>依实现而定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def cosine_similarity(a, b):&#10;    return np.dot(a, b) / (np.linalg.norm(a) * np.linalg.norm(b))&#10;&#10;def brute_force_search(query, vectors, top_k=5):&#10;    similarities = [&#10;        (i, cosine_similarity(query, v))&#10;        for i, v in enumerate(vectors)&#10;    ]&#10;    similarities.sort(key=lambda x: x[1], reverse=True)&#10;    return similarities[:top_k]&#10;&#10;np.random.seed(42)&#10;vectors = np.random.randn(1000, 768)&#10;query = np.random.randn(768)&#10;&#10;results = brute_force_search(query, vectors, top_k=3)&#10;for idx, score in results:&#10;    print(f&quot;  文档 {idx}: 相似度 = {score:.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cosine_similarity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, b):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.dot(a, b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (np.linalg.norm(a) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.linalg.norm(b))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> brute_force_search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query, vectors, top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    similarities </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        (i, cosine_similarity(query, v))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vectors)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    similarities.sort(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: x[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> similarities[:top_k]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">np.random.seed(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">vectors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brute_force_search(query, vectors, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">top_k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx, score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  文档 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">idx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: 相似度 = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"近似最近邻索引\">近似最近邻索引</h2><p>精确搜索在大规模数据上太慢，实际系统使用近似最近邻（ANN）算法在速度和召回率之间取得平衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ANN 算法</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>多层跳表图</td>\n<td>查询快，召回高</td>\n<td>内存占用大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IVF</td>\n<td>聚类 + 倒排索引</td>\n<td>内存友好</td>\n<td>需要训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PQ</td>\n<td>乘积量化压缩</td>\n<td>极省内存</td>\n<td>精度损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ScaNN</td>\n<td>Google 改进 ANN</td>\n<td>高吞吐</td>\n<td>依赖特定硬件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph HNSW[&quot;HNSW 多层图&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;第 2 层 (稀疏)&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;第 1 层 (中等)&quot;]&#10;        L1 --&gt; L0[&quot;第 0 层 (稠密)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph IVF[&quot;IVF 倒排索引&quot;]&#10;        C1[&quot;簇 1&quot;] --&gt; D1[&quot;文档集合&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;簇 2&quot;] --&gt; D2[&quot;文档集合&quot;]&#10;        C3[&quot;簇 3&quot;] --&gt; D3[&quot;文档集合&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph HNSW[\"HNSW 多层图\"]\n        L2[\"第 2 层 (稀疏)\"] --&gt; L1[\"第 1 层 (中等)\"]\n        L1 --&gt; L0[\"第 0 层 (稠密)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph IVF[\"IVF 倒排索引\"]\n        C1[\"簇 1\"] --&gt; D1[\"文档集合\"]\n        C2[\"簇 2\"] --&gt; D2[\"文档集合\"]\n        C3[\"簇 3\"] --&gt; D3[\"文档集合\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流向量数据库对比\">主流向量数据库对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>索引算法</th>\n<th>元数据过滤</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pinecone</td>\n<td>托管服务</td>\n<td>自研</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>云端</td>\n<td>快速上线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Milvus</td>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>HNSW/IVF/PQ</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>自部署/云</td>\n<td>大规模生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chroma</td>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>本地/嵌入式</td>\n<td>原型开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pgvector</td>\n<td>PG 扩展</td>\n<td>IVFFlat/HNSW</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>自部署</td>\n<td>已有 PG 基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FAISS</td>\n<td>库</td>\n<td>HNSW/IVF/PQ</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>嵌入式</td>\n<td>纯向量搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qdrant</td>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>自部署/云</td>\n<td>生产环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weaviate</td>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>GraphQL</td>\n<td>自部署/云</td>\n<td>多模态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战示例\">实战示例</h2><h3 id=\"chroma-快速原型\">Chroma（快速原型）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# pip install chromadb&#10;import chromadb&#10;&#10;client = chromadb.Client()&#10;collection = client.create_collection(&quot;docs&quot;)&#10;&#10;collection.add(&#10;    documents=[&#10;        &quot;Transformer 是一种基于注意力机制的神经网络架构&quot;,&#10;        &quot;BERT 使用掩码语言建模进行预训练&quot;,&#10;        &quot;GPT 使用因果语言建模进行自回归生成&quot;,&#10;        &quot;LoRA 是一种参数高效的微调方法&quot;,&#10;    ],&#10;    ids=[&quot;doc1&quot;, &quot;doc2&quot;, &quot;doc3&quot;, &quot;doc4&quot;],&#10;    metadatas=[&#10;        {&quot;topic&quot;: &quot;architecture&quot;},&#10;        {&quot;topic&quot;: &quot;pretraining&quot;},&#10;        {&quot;topic&quot;: &quot;pretraining&quot;},&#10;        {&quot;topic&quot;: &quot;fine-tuning&quot;},&#10;    ],&#10;)&#10;&#10;results = collection.query(&#10;    query_texts=[&quot;什么是注意力机制？&quot;],&#10;    n_results=2,&#10;    where={&quot;topic&quot;: &quot;architecture&quot;},&#10;)&#10;print(f&quot;查询结果: {results[&#39;documents&#39;]}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pip install chromadb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chromadb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client </span><span style=\"co