<span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.linalg.norm(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># distances, indices = index.search(query, k=5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># print(f\"最近邻索引: {indices[0]}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># print(f\"距离: {distances[0]}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"向量维度: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"索引大小: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_vectors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 条\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 对于生产环境，推荐 Milvus 或 Qdrant；对于快速原型，Chroma 最为简便；如果已有 PostgreSQL 基础设施，pgvector 是低门槛的选择。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>向量数据库是 RAG 系统的存储和检索核心，支持语义级别的相似度搜索。</li>\n<li>HNSW 是最常用的 ANN 索引算法，在查询速度和召回率之间表现优异。</li>\n<li>选择向量数据库需要综合考虑部署方式、规模需求、元数据过滤和生态集成。</li>\n<li>Chroma 适合原型开发，Milvus/Qdrant 适合生产环境，FAISS 适合纯向量搜索场景。</li>\n<li>元数据过滤能力是生产环境中的关键需求，可以显著提升检索精度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量数据库","id":"向量数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要向量数据库","id":"为什么需要向量数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"近似最近邻索引","id":"近似最近邻索引"},{"level":2,"text":"主流向量数据库对比","id":"主流向量数据库对比"},{"level":2,"text":"实战示例","id":"实战示例"},{"level":3,"text":"Chroma（快速原型）","id":"chroma-快速原型"},{"level":3,"text":"FAISS（高性能搜索）","id":"faiss-高性能搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据集准备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/fine-tuning/dataset-preparation"},"next":{"title":"嵌入模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/rag-and-retrieval/embedding-models"}}